percase tracking-widest font-bold\">Cours en ligne en direct</span></div><h1 class=\"font-display text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl leading-[1.1] max-w-5xl mx-auto text-white tracking-tight flex flex-col gap-2\"><span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block pb-2\"><span class=\"inline-block animate-reveal-up translate-y-[120%] opacity-0\">L&#x27;Excellence au Sénégal,</span></span><span class=\"overflow-hidden inline-block pb-2\"><span class=\"inline-block animate-reveal-up translate-y-[120%] opacity-0 [animation-delay:200ms]\"><span class=\"text-gradient font-bold\">pour le Bac et les Concours.</span></span></span></h1><p class=\"font-body text-white/70 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-8 font-light leading-relaxed animate-fade-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:400ms\">Maths, Physique-Chimie (PC) et SVT. Cours particuliers en direct sur WhatsApp, et des séries d&#x27;exercices d&#x27;excellence pour réussir au Sénégal.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mt-12 animate-fade-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:600ms\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/221788244692\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-solaire text-encre font-body font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-white transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto hover:scale-105 transition-transform\">Rejoindre le groupe WhatsApp</a><a class=\"w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-white/20 text-white font-body font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/series\">Parcourir les séries</a></div></div></section><section class=\"relative z-20 -mt-16 md:-mt-24 mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 animate-fade-in-up\" style=\"animation-delay:800ms\"><div class=\"bg-[#0a1930]/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2rem] shadow-[0_30px_60px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-solaire/10 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-100 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 -top-px h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-solaire/50 to-transparent opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 font-display text-[120px] text-white/[0.02] pointer-events-none select-none leading-none\">GTS</div><div class=\"flex-1 relative z-10\"><span class=\"inline-block py-1 px-4 rounded-full bg-solaire/10 text-solaire font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold mb-4 border border-solaire/20\">Comment ça marche</span><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight mb-4 text-white\">Séries libres, corrections premium.</h2><p class=\"font-body text-white/70 text-lg leading-relaxed\">Consultez nos séries d&#x27;exercices librement avec <strong class=\"text-white font-medium\">un exercice corrigé offert</strong> pour avoir un aperçu. Pour obtenir la correction complète et un accompagnement en direct, rejoignez nos cours privés sur WhatsApp.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 mt-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"text-white/40 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Inscription</span><span class=\"text-solaire font-display text-2xl\">1500F</span></div><div class=\"w-px h-10 bg-white/10\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"text-white/40 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Mensualité</span><span class=\"text-solaire font-display text-2xl\">1500F</span></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto text-center\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/221788244692\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-solaire text-encre font-body font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-white transition-colors w-full md:w-auto shadow-xl shadow-solaire/10 hover:scale-105 transition-transform\">Rejoindre les cours</a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-